# 256-Line Cap

All 39 files <= 256 lines. Largest is mcp_graph_dynamic.oo and test_t4_mcp_protocol.oo at 256 (cap).

# Generations G1-G22

G1   real-time:    mcp_server_handle_body
G2   session:      McpSession with R5 replay gate
G3   surface:      tier-based method surface (minimal/full/audit)
G4   transport:    stdio + file + unix-socket
G5   graph:        typed McpGraph (14 caps, 13 boards, 8 gates, substrate)
G6   version:      codexVersion + If-None-Match
G7   dynamic:      McpDynamicGraph with record/fold/persist/load
G8   gossip:       mcp_gossip_merge dedup
G9   cold-start:   mcp_dynamic_load on boot
G10  redteam:      8 periodic probes fire on session close
G11  cert:         mcp_g11_self_certify exercises 14 caps against actual use
G12  federate:     mcp_g12_federate_graphs merges local + peer by SHA-lex
G13  lineage:      mcp_g13_lineage_record appends versioned NDJSON entry per session
G14  line-cch:     mcp_g14_invalidate_caches clears G7 + invalidates G12; fires on every G13
G15  recover:      mcp_redteam_recover quarantines failing gates, emits JSON notification
G16  attest:       mcp_codex_re_attest re-hashes codex from disk; drift triggers rebuild
G17A chain:       mcp_g17_lineage_verify returns "ok" or "tamper@<idx>"
G17B reattest:    mcp_g17_reattest_if_due rehashes every N epochs
G17C refold:      mcp_g17_refold_after_quarantine clears hot/cold/unused/shadow and re-folds after G15
G17D gossip:      mcp_g17_gossip_publish/fetch on AF_UNIX; single-host peer-exchange
G17E bitmask:     mcp_g17_caps_bitmask_from_graph (14-bit mask via G19)
G18#6 config:     mcp_g18_reattest_interval_from_env reads $OODAREATTEST_INTERVAL, default 10
G18#7 heartbeat:  mcp_g18_heartbeat_publish/fetch on AF_UNIX; live state deltas
G19  caps-14:     mcp_g19_token_to_bit / mcp_g19_bit_to_token / mcp_g19_caps_bitmask_from_graph; full mask = 16383
G20N tcp-gossip:  mcp_g20_tcp_publish/fetch on TCP under TcpCap; multi-host peer-exchange
G20O compaction:  mcp_g20_compaction_run keeps last N entries, replaces older with single chained marker
G20P notify-q:    mcp_g20_revalidate_and_queue_caps enqueues notifications/cap_revoked; mcp_g20_drain_notifications flushes
G21R drain-rsp:   mcp_g21_drain_into_response drains the G20P queue on every server response
G21S tcp-lived:   mcp_g21_tcp_publish_long_lived (multi-accept) + mcp_g21_tcp_fetch_long_lived (retry)
G21T auto-comp:   mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due triggers G20O compaction on interval multiples
G22V wired-comp: mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due wired into mcp_server_run close sequence (interval=10, keep_recent=5)
G22W tcp-pub:     mcp_g22_fed_tcp_publish exposed for callers that want multi-host TCP publish (auto-publishes on $OODAFED_TCP_PORT)

# Cap Chain (Zero-Ambient)

main(bind, fs, sys, env, time, fs_w, args)
  -> run_ooda_mcp(bind, fw, fs, env, sys, args)
    -> mcp_server_run(bind, fw, fs, env, t)
      -> mcp_transport_read(bind, fw, fs, t)
      -> mcp_g17_reattest_if_due (G18#6 env-driven)        # G17B + G18#6
      -> mcp_dynamic_load(fs, path)                          # G9
      -> mcp_server_handle_body(fs, session, graph, codex, body)
        -> mcp_session_seen_id                              # R5
        -> mcp_dispatch_decide                              # phase + tier + URI
        -> mcp_dispatch_cap_audit (G19 14-bit)              # R7
        -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read (uses cache.graph_json)
        -> mcp_dispatch_act_resource_read_stream            # OODA streaming
        -> mcp_g21_drain_into_response                      # G21R (drain G20P queue)
      -> mcp_dynamic_fold + mcp_gossip_merge                # G7 + G8
      -> mcp_redteam_run_all                                # G10
      -> mcp_redteam_run_all_recovers (G17C)                # G15 -> G17C
      -> mcp_g11_self_certify                               # G11
      -> mcp_g12_local_export (G17D unix gossip)            # G12 -> G17D
      -> mcp_codex_resolve_federated                        # G12b
      -> mcp_g13_lineage_record -> G14 -> G17A              # G13 -> G14 -> G17A
      -> mcp_g21_auto_compact_if_due (G22V)                 # G22V (closes follow-up #3)
      -> mcp_g20_revalidate_and_queue_caps (G20P, enqueue) # G20P
      -> mcp_codex_re_attest                                # G16

# REDTEAM R1-R8

R1 subversion:  PASS — caps minted by runtime; no string-forged caps. G19 widens the surface to 14 tokens.
R2 exhaustion:  PASS — 256-msg cap removed; loop terminates on shutdown/close/EOF.
R3 obfuscation: PASS — lsp_jsonrpc_escape on every string field.
R4 injection:   PASS — mcp_orient_uri_is_canonical gates URIs to 6 values.
R5 replay:      PASS — mcp_session_seen_id returns -32603 on duplicate id.
R6 traversal:   PASS — mcp_sampling_root_allows rejects non-ooda:// outside roots.
R7 escalation:  PASS (RUNTIME) — mcp_dispatch_cap_audit returns -32603 if caller lacks cap. G19: 14-bit surface.
R8 integrity:   PASS — mcp_codex_substrate_attest computes live SHA-256 of LLMS.oot. G22V: auto-compact keeps lineage bounded.

